This catalog is a snapshot of the curated metadata shipped by the original
selexprep project, imported during the R migration. It is included as package
data so discovery is reproducible and works without network access.

The records are derived from public ENA study metadata and are distributed as
part of this package under its MIT license.

The catalog is metadata only. Before downloading data, use
inspect_selexprep_accession() to obtain current ENA records and verify that an
accession is still available.
